  "description": "Ji-woo Kang visits her regular fortune-teller as usual, but suddenly hears shocking news: \"If you don't find a partner this year, you're destined to live alone forever.\" Ji-woo, who became perpetually single while waiting for her perfect ideal type, becomes anxious after hearing the fortune-teller's words. To make matters worse, she's told she needs to find not just any man, but the man she saw in her \"dreams\"! \"I'd rather die than live alone!!\" Will Ji-woo be able to safely find her destined man?\n\n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4684-it-s-not-a-dream)",
